   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{961CAF63DB2D7C47}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "Enemy forces are committing a significant force to push us out of our trench line in a previously quiet sector. They have gained significant ground already and are already within grenade range of our troops at the front line."\
     ""\
     "Note there are scatterable AT/AP Minefields marked on your map. These marks are general areas, only the trenches themselves are truly safe."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_TKA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{084F75D46E459702}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "A Russian Company (-) attempt to dislodge CDF Foreign Legion from a trench system on a drone saturated front line."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Notes</h2>"\
     "• 8 Respawns for CDF."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{42EFB02BC7C68C90}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "We have gained a foothold in the enemy's trench line and our lead platoon (AI) is actively engaged within grenade range. If we can push the enemy out of their trench system we can continue onward to capture their position in depth at the farm."\
     ""\
     "Note there are scatterable AT/AP Minefields marked on your map. These marks are general areas, only the trenches themselves are truly safe."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E4632FE6FA5DE9E0}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Situation Enemy"
     m_sContent "We are dealing with a company (-), with the lead platoon heavily attritted while gaining lodgment but still effective. They have a fresh platoon on ground now and we are expecting imminent reinforcements. Some elements are marked on your map."\
     ""\
     "They are wearing dark green digital camo, and are using AK74s, PKPs, RPGs and UBGL's with some optics amongst their squads."\
     ""\
     "They have moderate UAS support (including droppers) and some old IFV's they may commit to their push."\
     ""\
     "They have no counter-UAS."\
     ""\
     "MLCOA: Rapidly reinforce their progress and push us out of our trench line"\
     "MDCOA: Utilize UAS to identify and destroy our HQ and prevent medevac/reinforcement along our supply route, before using our trenchline as a base of fire to push onwards to our position at the farm."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_TKA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7BBAE1BBA619D59C}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Mission Notes"
     m_sContent "<h2>END CONDITIONS</h2>"\
     "<b>OPFOR VICTORY</b>"\
     "• Both the Trench System and Farm objectives are secured."\
     "OR"\
     "•90% of BLUFOR personnel are killed."\
     ""\
     "<b>BLUFOR VICTORY</b>"\
     "• BLUFOR retains control of the Trench System when the 60-minute time limit expires."\
     "OR"\
     "• 70% of OPFOR personnel are killed."\
     ""\
     "<h2>NOTES</h2>"\
     "• Time limit: 60 minutes."\
     "• Force ratio: 2.4:1 (OPFOR:BLUFOR)."\
     "• OPFOR Company HQ and BLUFOR Platoon Leader must be slotted. These roles are expected to lead their respective forces using the drone feed, at least until all respawns are in play."\
     "• Trench System capture timer: 2 minutes."\
     "• Farm capture timer: 5 minutes."\
     "• Objectives can be retaken."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{56316A01013E36B9}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Situation Enemy"
     m_sContent "Our lead platoon (AI) is in grenade range of a platoon of CDF foreign legion fighters, with reinforcements being sent to reinforce their position now. Some elements are marked on your map. They are occupying positions in depth at the farm as well."\
     ""\
     "They are wearing green brown striped camouflage and are using M16s, M240s, RPGs and UBGL's."\
     ""\
     "They have limited offensive UAS support, if any."\
     ""\
     "They have no counter-UAS."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0FCBFCD76F237881}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Situation Friendly"
     m_sContent "We have a platoon (-) (AI) committed in the trench line that we've lost communications with, and two squads (Players) prepared to reinforce them at the farm"\
     ""\
     "Our Platoon HQ is located in the rear with our drone operator and medics with their medevac vehicle."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_TKA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A5C07D821D29E828}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Situation Friendly"
     m_sContent "We have a platoon (-) (AI) committed in the trench line that we've lost communications with, with a fresh platoon (Players) in the rear most trench."\
     ""\
     "A second reinforcement platoon (Players) is on their way from 022 022."\
     ""\
     "Our COY HQ is located at 018 036 with our drone operators, medical personnel and our vehicles."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{65C7843BBBFF2288}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "Our Platoon must delay the capture of our trench position for 60 minutes. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_TKA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{980E8D5A4A97FBC0}" {
     m_iOrder 9
